   "source": [
    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "## Step 5: Full Preprocessing Pipeline\n",
    "\n",
    "The full pipeline extends the raw pipeline with three additional steps:\n",
    "\n",
    "| Step | Technique | Purpose |\n",
    "|------|-----------|---------|\n",
    "| 1 | **SMOTE** | Balance class distribution (minority oversampling) |\n",
    "| 2 | **StandardScaler** | Normalize feature values (zero mean, unit variance) |\n",
    "| 3 | **Stratified Split** | Ensure balanced class distribution in train/test |\n",
    "\n",
    "### 5.1 Class Imbalance Handling - SMOTE\n",
    "\n",
    "The original dataset had ~5,200 non-churn vs ~1,800 churn customers.  \n",
    "This imbalance causes models to be **biased toward the majority class**, resulting in poor recall.  \n",
    "SMOTE generates **synthetic minority samples** until the distribution is balanced 50/50."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 17,
   "id": "1d43a6451fe9c10b",
   "metadata": {
    "ExecuteTime": {
     "end_time": "2026-05-20T20:47:18.576963Z",
     "start_time": "2026-05-20T20:47:18.493950Z"
    }
   },
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "Before SMOTE - Class 0: 5,174  |  Class 1: 1,869\n",
      "After  SMOTE - Class 0: 5,174  |  Class 1: 5,174\n",
      "\n",
      "Synthetic samples added: 3,374\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "df_clean = df.copy()\n",
    "\n",
    "df_clean.drop(LEAKAGE_COLS, axis=1, inplace=True)\n",
    "\n",
    "# Convert and impute\n",
    "df_clean['Total Charges'] = pd.to_numeric(df_clean['Total Charges'], errors='coerce')\n",
    "df_clean['Total Charges'] = df_clean['Total Charges'].fillna(df_clean['Total Charges'].median())\n",
    "\n",
    "# Label encode\n",
    "le2 = LabelEncoder()\n",
    "for col in df_clean.columns:\n",
    "    if df_clean[col].dtype == 'object':\n",
    "        df_clean[col] = le2.fit_transform(df_clean[col])\n",
    "\n",
    "X = df_clean.drop('Churn Value', axis=1)\n",
    "y = df_clean['Churn Value']\n",
    "\n",
    "print(f'Before SMOTE - Class 0: {(y==0).sum():,}  |  Class 1: {(y==1).sum():,}')\n",
    "\n",
    "# Apply SMOTE\n",
    "smote = SMOTE(random_state=42)\n",
    "X, y = smote.fit_resample(X, y)\n",
    "\n",
    "print(f'After  SMOTE - Class 0: {(y==0).sum():,}  |  Class 1: {(y==1).sum():,}')\n",
    "print(f'\\nSynthetic samples added: {(y==1).sum() - 1800:,}')"
   ]
  },
