   "source": [
    "### 5.2 Feature Scaling - StandardScaler\n",
    "\n",
    "The dataset has features with very different ranges:\n",
    "- `Tenure Months` → small values (0-72)\n",
    "- `Total Charges` → large values (0-9,000)\n",
    "\n",
    "**StandardScaler** normalizes all features to zero mean and unit variance.  \n",
    "This is critical for **KNN** (distance-based) and **Logistic Regression** (gradient-based).\n",
    "\n",
    "### 5.3 Train-Test Split\n",
    "\n",
    "An 80/20 split is applied **after** SMOTE and scaling."
   ]
