    "## Step 5: Run Apriori & FP-Growth (with Runtime Measurement)\n",
    "\n",
    "Both algorithms run on **identical data and thresholds** for a fair comparison.\n",
    "\n",
    "### Apriori\n",
    "- Generates candidate itemsets level by level\n",
    "- Scans the full database once per itemset length: slower on large datasets\n",
    "\n",
    "### FP-Growth\n",
    "- Compresses the database into a compact **FP-Tree** in two passes\n",
    "- Mines patterns directly from the tree with no candidate generation: faster\n",
    "\n",
    "After mining, rules with **lift ≤ 1.2** are filtered from both outputs.\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 37,
   "id": "db97ba8d4a10c25e",
   "metadata": {
    "ExecuteTime": {
